==Battleground==
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 25.33 seconds<sup>760f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns after 28.67 seconds<sup>860f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns after 12.67 seconds<sup>380f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns after 9.33 seconds<sup>280f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns after 9.33 seconds<sup>280f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns after 12.67 seconds<sup>380f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As a bunch of Pigge Backs spawn very early on, most cats could not survive long before their consecutive attacks. Hence, it is best to stall for time using [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] to save up for [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or other powerful cats. Otherwise, employ your typical strategies.

==Trivia==
*The name of this stage may be a reference to the [[wikipedia:Chicken Run|animated movie of the same name]].

